- !<Text/e47e17b9-d407-4dff-aeca-1d1b2093c832>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Snap Cloud Social Media records a clip or photo through your Specs and shares it to the social destinations you turn on.
    
    It starts in demo mode: sharing is simulated, so you don't need accounts or credentials.
    
    Pinch Record or Photo, edit the caption, pick destinations and formats, then press Simulate share.
